                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Im not usualy one to review games but here we go. I was having so much fun with this game. i typically play games like gallop racer and g1 jockey so i thought id give a racing sim a go. This game is very fun not going to lie. I loved how it has all the big races that we are used to watching. I loved winning these races and building up a dynasty with my bred horses. But then came the crashes..... My first crash my heart sank. I soon realised you could play a backed up file. I loaded it up and lost about 3 hours progress, very frustrating. I played for a while and it crashed again.. Oh no.. It then got to the point where it was crashing every couple of saves. This completly stuffs up the lore of your stable because different horses end up winning the races before the crash. I understand that the crashes are to do with corrupted replay files. So if you start a new game do not enable replays! (which sucks because i like watching my 2yos replays if i dont watch there debut win). So all in all i think wait for the upccoming Starters orders 8 and hope the crashes are fixed!",
